  "query_preview": "..\nPeriods of weak scattered showers tonight will become isolated\ntomorrow with the exception of minor island effect showers over part\nof southern Guam. Isolated thunderstorms ahead of Bavi will begin as\nsoon as Saturday, becoming scattered Sunday. Shower chances will be\nisolated Friday night into Saturday morning before increasing to\nscattered Saturday afternoon as PWAT values increase ahead of Bavi.\nShowers are expected to become numerous with locally heavy showers\npossible Sunday, before becoming widespread heavy showers Sunday \nnight into Monday. Strong, gusty winds Saturday night will likely \nreach tropical storm conditions Sunday and increase rapidly to \nTyphoon conditions late Sunday night or early Monday. Tropical storm \nconditions may return Monday night, dropping to windy by Tuesday.",
